1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">显著；引人注目；辉煌；壮观；惊人；出众；非凡</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">目覚める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めざめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">醒来；苏醒；觉醒；意识到；认识到；（本能、能力、知觉等）萌发；恢复理智；清醒</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"160690\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はこんなに<ruby>早<rp>(</rp><rt>はや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く<ruby>目覚<rp>(</rp><rt>めざ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めたことはない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I&#x27;ve never woken up this early.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">召す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">召唤；传召；邀请；召请；吃；喝；穿；戴；买；购买；洗澡；乘坐；上车；搭乘；感冒；着凉；增岁；变老；合意；称心；令人满意；做；干；切腹自尽；表示尊敬</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76810\">お<ruby>祖父<rp>(</rp><rt>そふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さまはお<ruby>風邪<rp>(</rp><rt>かぜ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>召<rp>(</rp><rt>め</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>していらっしゃいます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Grandfather has caught a cold.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">雌</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">雌