p><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こったとすれば、<ruby>人類<rp>(</rp><rt>じんるい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>滅亡<rp>(</rp><rt>めつぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するだろう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">If a nuclear war were to break out, mankind would perish.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">メディア</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">媒体；传播媒介</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223116\">このメディアには<ruby>記録<rp>(</rp><rt>きろく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>することができない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It is not possible to record in this media.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">目盛</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めもり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">刻度；分度；刻线；标度</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">メロディー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">旋律；曲调</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223115\">このメロディーは<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くの<ruby>日本人<rp>(</rp><rt>にほんじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This melody is familiar to many Japanese.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">面会</sp